    ["◆甜冰茶"] = "◆ Sweet Iced Tea",
    ["　　认识“审判官”是偶然。他真名叫布莱克，是议院治安队的中间人，还挺能打的，我亲眼见过他用一把锯刀砍翻了十个人。\n　　但作为朋友，他说话和气，出手阔绰。第一次他请我喝酒，说只是想交个朋友。第二次他送我一块怀表，说是感谢我帮了他小忙。第三次他问我，有没有兴趣赚点外快。\n　　我说，我是警察。\n　　他说，警察也是人。\n　　我把怀表还给他，转身走了。但那个念头又冒出来——钱能买来更大的权力。我只是借用一下，等站稳脚跟，再收拾他们也不迟。\n　　一周后，我给他打了个电话。"] = "　　Meeting the \"Inquisitor\" was accidental. His real name is Black, and he is a middleman for the council's security team. He is quite capable of fighting; I have seen with my own eyes how he used a saw-blade to hack down ten people. \n　　But as a friend, he speaks gently and is generous with his money. The first time he treated me to a drink, he said he just wanted to make a friend. The second time he gave me a pocket watch, saying it was to thank me for helping him with a small favor. The third time he asked me if I was interested in earning some extra money. \n　　I said, I am a policeman. \n　　He said, policemen are also human. \n　　I returned the pocket watch to him and turned to leave. But that thought popped up again—money can buy greater power. I'm just borrowing it; it won't be too late to deal with them after I stand firm. \n　　A week later, I gave him a call.",
