    ["乌托邦剧院近日出现异常波动。某位外层存在的力量渗透现实，腐化了剧院内部分秘偶的残余意识，这些被腐化的秘偶试图通过与克莱恩相关的记忆物品，建立一条通向愚者精神的隐秘通道。一旦成功，母神将有能力影响愚者的精神，波及整个南大陆。教会需要有人进入曾经的乌托邦小镇，清理失控的秘偶，调查残存的记忆，最终切断污染的来源。\n\n每周竞速通关成绩进入本途径前100名的玩家将会获得专属头衔，为保证竞速公平，剧院中的敌人等级将会在每周一早上8:00更新。\n此难度下，舞台余韵获取效率是普通难度的2倍。"] = "Utopia Theater has recently experienced abnormal fluctuations. The power of an Outer Deity has penetrated reality, corrupting the residual consciousness of some marionettes in the theater. These corrupted marionettes are attempting to establish a secret channel to the Fool's spirit through memory items related to Klein. Once successful, the Mother Goddess will have the ability to affect the Fool's spirit, affecting the entire Southern Continent. The Church needs someone to enter the former Utopia town, clear the out-of-control marionettes, investigate the remaining memories, and finally cut off the source of the corruption. \n\n Players whose weekly speedrun results enter the top 100 of this Pathway will receive an exclusive title. To ensure fairness in speedrunning, the level of enemies in the theater will be updated every Monday at 8:00 AM. \n At this difficulty, the efficiency of obtaining Stage Aftertaste is 2 times that of normal difficulty.",
